r><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>J</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>K</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mi>K</mi></menclose><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>J</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>J</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"59\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 11.204em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><m