>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We disregard the positive solution since we are told that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"361\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"362\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
