playstyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>u</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>u</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We can further simplify the above by writing <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"390\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>K</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> for another arbitrary positive constant <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"391\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and then we can combine the two terms using the laws of logarithms, as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"392\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 17.95em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mj