    "q-116735": {
      "dom_id": "questionContainer",
      "name": "Question 42",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14270828/assets/63fe9cf3a61a5cef09f9c19e16a18318338faa6837eeb77b83f49b636157bb95.png)\n\nA sphere is decreasing in volume at a rate of $54\\pi \\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}\\text{/s}.$ Calculate the rate at which the radius of the sphere is decreasing at the moment when the radius is $3\\,\\text{cm}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let $r$ be the radius of the balloon and $V$ its volume. Both $r$ and $V$ change with time. In particular, we are given\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}=-54\\pi \\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}/\\text{s},\n$$\n\nand we want to find $\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}$ when $r=3\\,\\text{cm}.$\n\nTo start, let's write down the volume formula for the sphere and then differentiate it using implicit differentiation. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & =\\frac{4}{3}\\pi {r}^{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(V) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{4}{3}\\pi {r}^{3}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}r}(\\frac{4}{3}\\pi {r}^{3}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot 4\\pi {r}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we can substitute the given information $\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}=-54\\pi $ and $r=3,$ and solve for $\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-54\\pi  & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot 4\\pi (3)^{2} \\\\ -54\\pi  & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot 36\\pi  \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} & =-1.5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the radius of the sphere is decreasing at a rate of $1.5\\text{ cm/s}$ when the radius is $3\\,\\text{cm}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-116735-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "1.5\\text{ cm/s}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"546\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cA0\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1.5</mn><mtext>&nbsp;cm/s</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
